(5010625, 731153, 16230, '<td valign="top">I foresee high marks for originality with this image. :) Unfortunately, I also foresee lower marks for execution. :(<br/> <br/>On the plus side, the idea itself is wonderful. It certainly fits the subject of the challenge. On the minus side, the wrinkled cloth background and lighting do nothing to improve the image. A more natural setting for a fishbowl might have worked better. The kitten and fish both appear flat and unnatural, like cutouts.<br/> <br/>I think I''ll give this a 7 because I love the concept so much.</td>', 'I foresee high marks for originality with this image. :) Unfortunately, I also foresee lower marks for execution. :( On the plus side, the idea itself is wonderful. It certainly fits the subject of the challenge. On the minus side, the wrinkled cloth background and lighting do nothing to improve the image. A more natural setting for a fishbowl might have worked better. The kitten and fish both appear flat and unnatural, like cutouts. I think I''ll give this a 7 because I love the concept so much.', '2008-10-15 20:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010634, 731003, 55956, '<td valign="top">I see a bit of irony in this image. my interpretation of the upside down go in the direction of the recent wall street(but not only wall streeet) crisys. it''s right? it seems say:"hey guys(as speaking with the govern represented by the flag) here there aren'' money!".  on the technical aspect of the photo, I really like this image, good the black and white,the composition, the sharpness. really a good image.</td>', 'I see a bit of irony in this image. my interpretation of the upside down go in the direction of the recent wall street(but not only wall streeet) crisys. it''s right? it seems say:"hey guys(as speaking with the govern represented by the flag) here there aren'' money!".  on the technical aspect of the photo, I really like this image, good the black and white,the composition, the sharpness. really a good image.', '2008-10-15 20:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010635, 731072, 16230, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool image. Unfortunately, it doesn''t exactly nail the challenge criteria. Viewed by itself without the photo and challenge titles, the image wouldn''t make me think "inside out", but rather "what''s going on in there?"<br/> <br/>It''s still an interesting image though, so I''ll give it an above average score.</td>', 'This is a very cool image. Unfortunately, it doesn''t exactly nail the challenge criteria. Viewed by itself without the photo and challenge titles, the image wouldn''t make me think "inside out", but rather "what''s going on in there?" It''s still an interesting image though, so I''ll give it an above average score.', '2008-10-15 20:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010641, 730971, 16230, '<td valign="top">Looking out from inside the monster,eh? Well, this <i>is</i> different. You did a good job with the teeth. I think it would be even better with something on the outside to grab the viewer''s attention. A terrified woman screaming, or perhaps even a sandwich? :D</td>', 'Looking out from inside the monster,eh? Well, this is different. You did a good job with the teeth. I think it would be even better with something on the outside to grab the viewer''s attention. A terrified woman screaming, or perhaps even a sandwich? :D', '2008-10-15 20:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5010645, 730818, 16230, '<td valign="top">Very well executed!</td>', 'Very well executed!', '2008-10-15 20:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
