(5010670, 730880, 55956, '<td valign="top">well, this is a very good photo. there are a lot of thing to say about this photo. the idea is good, the girl inside the building, the reflection of the sun(?)on the building and the convex umbrella create a great surreal image. the colours are interesting, from the satured green on the foreground to the cyan of the background, good the pose of the model,apparel cured in the details, good choice for the stopped hats for hide that there isn''t wind. the format 16:9 is a good choice. beautiful model. 10</td>', 'well, this is a very good photo. there are a lot of thing to say about this photo. the idea is good, the girl inside the building, the reflection of the sun(?)on the building and the convex umbrella create a great surreal image. the colours are interesting, from the satured green on the foreground to the cyan of the background, good the pose of the model,apparel cured in the details, good choice for the stopped hats for hide that there isn''t wind. the format 16:9 is a good choice. beautiful model. 10', '2008-10-15 20:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
