(5010675, 731147, 55956, '<td valign="top">very creative photo, the few colours used are a good choice, I like the composition and the idea, the reflection is always a good thing for obtain some higher vote :) interesting the milk curve but the winner card of this image is the simplicity of the color. 10</td>', 'very creative photo, the few colours used are a good choice, I like the composition and the idea, the reflection is always a good thing for obtain some higher vote :) interesting the milk curve but the winner card of this image is the simplicity of the color. 10', '2008-10-15 21:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
