(5012498, 731003, 60495, '<td valign="top">I do not find the photo to be all that eye catching but I do find the take on the subject to be fascinating and I am betting it will be be missed by most speed voters.</td>', 'I do not find the photo to be all that eye catching but I do find the take on the subject to be fascinating and I am betting it will be be missed by most speed voters.', '2008-10-17 15:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
