(5012505, 731153, 60495, '<td valign="top">This may have been a contender based on the idea but unfortunatly the wrinkled background really hurts the shot. I would love to see this done again with a good back ground and the cats eyes looking more in the direction of the fish.  Really creative, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This may have been a contender based on the idea but unfortunatly the wrinkled background really hurts the shot. I would love to see this done again with a good back ground and the cats eyes looking more in the direction of the fish.  Really creative, good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-17 15:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5012516, 731128, 60495, '<td valign="top">Fun image, I tought of doing this type of shot but I was to lazy to move the furniture. The baloon in the background adds some interest to the shot, I assume it was just there by luck especailly the way it is framed by the trees.</td>', 'Fun image, I tought of doing this type of shot but I was to lazy to move the furniture. The baloon in the background adds some interest to the shot, I assume it was just there by luck especailly the way it is framed by the trees.', '2008-10-17 15:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
