(5019607, 731153, 53964, '<td valign="top">This would be a perfect setup with advanced rules. It''s sooo cute!<br/>Something was bothering me about the cat''s feet and I finally figured out that it was because they cast no shadows, making the gravel really neon-y.  In advanced you could touch that up in a moment. Would LOVE to see a re-edit now that rule restraints are off... please? :)</td>', 'This would be a perfect setup with advanced rules. It''s sooo cute!Something was bothering me about the cat''s feet and I finally figured out that it was because they cast no shadows, making the gravel really neon-y.  In advanced you could touch that up in a moment. Would LOVE to see a re-edit now that rule restraints are off... please? :)', '2008-10-22 02:09:25.000000', NULL, 0),
