(5019640, 731072, 9763, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the compliments and comments!  I felt it was inside out, since that''s how I painted it.  The subjects are "subjective" and there was no firm definition for Inside Out.  I saw some above me that seemed even less so.  Anyhow, it was great fun and I''m very happy to be in the top 25!  :)</td>', 'Thanks for the compliments and comments!  I felt it was inside out, since that''s how I painted it.  The subjects are "subjective" and there was no firm definition for Inside Out.  I saw some above me that seemed even less so.  Anyhow, it was great fun and I''m very happy to be in the top 25!  :)', '2008-10-22 02:31:57.000000', NULL, 0),
