(5019650, 730666, 76430, '<td valign="top">Ah, sure enough it is a mango.  We have lots of them here and I cut them like that sometimes to help cut the skin off easier and you can''t very easily turn a cantaloupe inside out. You did well with the lighting.  I wish you had gotten more comments.  FWIW I gave you a 7.</td>', 'Ah, sure enough it is a mango.  We have lots of them here and I cut them like that sometimes to help cut the skin off easier and you can''t very easily turn a cantaloupe inside out. You did well with the lighting.  I wish you had gotten more comments.  FWIW I gave you a 7.', '2008-10-22 02:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
