(5020357, 730347, 42198, '<td valign="top">This was my ''10'' for the challenge. I thought it was a great shot, I love the colours you achieved in post-processing. Perhaps the ''inside-out'' part was too subtle for the voters?</td>', 'This was my ''10'' for the challenge. I thought it was a great shot, I love the colours you achieved in post-processing. Perhaps the ''inside-out'' part was too subtle for the voters?', '2008-10-22 12:22:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020368, 730920, 68947, '<td valign="top">I didn''t enter this challenge because I couldn''t come up with a concept for it!  So, I have to say that I thought this was ingenious actually!  And, while I had no idea who this shot belonged to while voting, I can honestly say that this was a great shot and concept.  <br/> <br/>For someone who is going along, TRYING to find something to create a negative comment, anything is fair game!  <br/> <br/>The voting in here lately has been really "off kilter" as have some of the comments.  I have no idea what has been happening in here but, I can say that some people wouldn''t know a good shot if it came up and hit them in the face! :)<br/> <br/>And, the routing comments were so helpful, were they not?! ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-22 11:35:34.</i></td>', 'I didn''t enter this challenge because I couldn''t come up with a concept for it!  So, I have to say that I thought this was ingenious actually!  And, while I had no idea who this shot belonged to while voting, I can honestly say that this was a great shot and concept.   For someone who is going along, TRYING to find something to create a negative comment, anything is fair game!   The voting in here lately has been really "off kilter" as have some of the comments.  I have no idea what has been happening in here but, I can say that some people wouldn''t know a good shot if it came up and hit them in the face! :) And, the routing comments were so helpful, were they not?! ;-)', '2008-10-22 12:33:08.000000', '2008-10-22 12:35:34.000000', 0),
(5020381, 731104, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo. SOmething different as I have never seen a field full of tubs before. I like how there is water in just one of them also.</td>', 'Very cool photo. SOmething different as I have never seen a field full of tubs before. I like how there is water in just one of them also.', '2008-10-22 12:43:28.000000', NULL, 0),
