(5020508, 731153, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very creative idea for this challenge, nice humor to it too.  <br/> <br/>As for your lighting concern that you would get too much glare/reflection in your attempt to blow out the background - it looks like your subject was fairly close to your background, and  perhaps moving the background much farther back and lighting it separately with a flash would avoid the issue of reflection, or at least make it more manageable.  I''m guessing, no expert advice - I''ve been reading up on lighting lately and that''s what comes to mind when reading of your difficulty.</td>', 'Very creative idea for this challenge, nice humor to it too.   As for your lighting concern that you would get too much glare/reflection in your attempt to blow out the background - it looks like your subject was fairly close to your background, and  perhaps moving the background much farther back and lighting it separately with a flash would avoid the issue of reflection, or at least make it more manageable.  I''m guessing, no expert advice - I''ve been reading up on lighting lately and that''s what comes to mind when reading of your difficulty.', '2008-10-22 13:54:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020509, 730944, 35720, '<td valign="top">Great idea, congrats on the yellow ribbon!</td>', 'Great idea, congrats on the yellow ribbon!', '2008-10-22 13:54:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020514, 731144, 61651, '<td valign="top">The shadows are what I like about it.  Nice subtle idea for this challenge, and well-executed.</td>', 'The shadows are what I like about it.  Nice subtle idea for this challenge, and well-executed.', '2008-10-22 13:56:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020686, 730818, 97166, '<td valign="top">The real disappointment here is that had you shot this is a clean, well-lit studio environment, it probably would have ribboned ;)</td>', 'The real disappointment here is that had you shot this is a clean, well-lit studio environment, it probably would have ribboned ;)', '2008-10-22 15:05:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020701, 730818, 37845, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by K10DGuy:</b></div><hr/><i> The real disappointment here is that had you shot this is a clean, well-lit studio environment, it probably would have ribboned ;) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yea really.... i can just imagine giving directions to my jackolantern, and having it get all sick over my studio. I didnt want to risk shorting out the lights ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by K10DGuy: The real disappointment here is that had you shot this is a clean, well-lit studio environment, it probably would have ribboned ;)   Yea really.... i can just imagine giving directions to my jackolantern, and having it get all sick over my studio. I didnt want to risk shorting out the lights ;)', '2008-10-22 15:20:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5020860, 730248, 86447, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your BLUE!!</td>', 'Congratulations on your BLUE!!', '2008-10-22 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 0),
