(5022097, 730920, 62318, '<td valign="top">Very clever. Love the bright opposing colors. <br/> <br/>Eh, if you wanted a better score, you should have probably taken those peppers off the plate and put them against a uniform blue background. But then it would be contrived. I think it is great and more real the way it is.  Maybe f4 would have would have been a bit better, dunno. <br/> <br/>I''ve learned that people vote with their eyes, then they go back and just to justify the score they gave ending up as nitpicking. Half the time I don''t believe people believe what they right as it reflects to the score they give.</td>', 'Very clever. Love the bright opposing colors.  Eh, if you wanted a better score, you should have probably taken those peppers off the plate and put them against a uniform blue background. But then it would be contrived. I think it is great and more real the way it is.  Maybe f4 would have would have been a bit better, dunno.  I''ve learned that people vote with their eyes, then they go back and just to justify the score they gave ending up as nitpicking. Half the time I don''t believe people believe what they right as it reflects to the score they give.', '2008-10-23 12:47:58.000000', NULL, 0),
