(5023216, 731055, 67697, '<td valign="top">ok so i am slacking again - slacking here, slacking on the job, slacking on life (but the kids are clean and fed - one point for me! hehe)<br/> <br/>ok first let me say that if you want to write an "essay" for your title - you keep on doing that.  :)  If anyone doesn''t want to read it, it really shouldn''t be your problem.<br/> <br/>Anywho, I think this is very well done.  I did not vote on it of course (because I knew it was yours) but probably would have given it at least a 7.  I love the lighting on it.  You will have to tell me what you used.  Just a regular lamp?  What kind of bulb?  Oh that is right, you have moved into "fancy-pants" lighting now.  :P<br/> <br/>Anyway, love the composition and looooooooove the teeth marks.  What a scream!  And yes, I see that your yummy oreos beat my slimy inside-out pepper pbbbbt  hehe<br/> <br/>Sooooo.... nice job!</td>', 'ok so i am slacking again - slacking here, slacking on the job, slacking on life (but the kids are clean and fed - one point for me! hehe) ok first let me say that if you want to write an "essay" for your title - you keep on doing that.  :)  If anyone doesn''t want to read it, it really shouldn''t be your problem. Anywho, I think this is very well done.  I did not vote on it of course (because I knew it was yours) but probably would have given it at least a 7.  I love the lighting on it.  You will have to tell me what you used.  Just a regular lamp?  What kind of bulb?  Oh that is right, you have moved into "fancy-pants" lighting now.  :P Anyway, love the composition and looooooooove the teeth marks.  What a scream!  And yes, I see that your yummy oreos beat my slimy inside-out pepper pbbbbt  hehe Sooooo.... nice job!', '2008-10-24 10:32:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5023860, 731153, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great photo Mark. I never understood the picture of art rule that seems to be selectively enforced. I believe this restriction is a bit hypocritical.. Unless it includes buildings, statues (Ones of an Icelandic boat comes to mind) and other forms albiet practical forms of art.... Keep shooting. You have a real talent.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-10-24 19:39:33.</i></td>', 'Great photo Mark. I never understood the picture of art rule that seems to be selectively enforced. I believe this restriction is a bit hypocritical.. Unless it includes buildings, statues (Ones of an Icelandic boat comes to mind) and other forms albiet practical forms of art.... Keep shooting. You have a real talent.', '2008-10-24 19:04:35.000000', '2008-10-24 20:39:33.000000', 0),
