(5031352, 730996, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hey, you say in the descrip. that you think it might be a little bit blurry, but I think it works for the mood of this pic. The black makes him look very lonely. There was another inside-out teddy pic in the comp. that was surrounded by other "normal" bears, and I think I like the way they filled the frame better, but at least it looks like your velvet is working! :) Would you believe this is also the first thing I thought of? Didn''t enter this round, though.</td>', 'Hey, you say in the descrip. that you think it might be a little bit blurry, but I think it works for the mood of this pic. The black makes him look very lonely. There was another inside-out teddy pic in the comp. that was surrounded by other "normal" bears, and I think I like the way they filled the frame better, but at least it looks like your velvet is working! :) Would you believe this is also the first thing I thought of? Didn''t enter this round, though.', '2008-10-29 15:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
